<title>USA: Newark, N.J. $39 mln reoffered at 5.35 pct in 2011.</title>
<headline>Newark, N.J. $39 mln reoffered at 5.35 pct in 2011.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co said Tuesday it won $39.4 million Newark, N.J., improvement bonds, reoffering the bonds at a top yield of 5.35 percent in 2011.</p>
<p>A bid by Merrill Lynch was reported as the winner, but was rejected because it was late, market sources said.</p>
